  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Youth for Climate-Resilient Conservation and Sustainable Livelihoods in Volcanoes Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim of this action is to empower youth organizations to lead sustainable environmental stewardship in the Volcanoes Region of Rwanda, thereby promoting sustainable buffer zone management, community participation, and biodiversity conservation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The three project Outcomes are;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Outcome 1: &lt;/em&gt;Enhanced capacity of youth organizations to lead climate and conservation actions in the Volcanoes Region,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outcome 2: Improved biodiversity conservation and ecosystem health in the buffer zones of Volcanoes National Park,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outcome 3: Increased awareness and adoption of nature-based solutions (NBS) among local communities for ecosystem protection and sustainable resource management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project outputs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;1.1 &lt;/em&gt;Climate change adaptation, biodiversity conservation, and sustainable resource management training workshops conducted,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;1.2 &lt;/em&gt;Youth-led projects developed and implemented with support and mentorship from the project,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;1.3 &lt;/em&gt;Knowledge exchange and networking among youth organizations facilitated,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;2.1 &lt;/em&gt;Reforestation and habitat restoration initiatives in VNP landscapes and buffer zones implemented,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;2.2 &lt;/em&gt;Community-based conservation initiatives established,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;2.3 &lt;/em&gt;Sustainable land use practices, including agroforestry and regenerative agriculture, in the buffer zones promoted,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;3.1 &lt;/em&gt;Community outreach and education campaigns on the importance of biodiversity, ecosystem services, and sustainable resource management conducted,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;3.2 &lt;/em&gt;Nature-based solutions, such as rainwater harvesting, soil conservation, and renewable energy technologies promoted and adopted,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;3.3 &lt;/em&gt;Local communities engaged in participatory planning and decision-making processes related to buffer zone management and conservation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
